<title>UK: Reckitt shares rise on Unilever results.</title>
<headline>Reckitt shares rise on Unilever results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British consumer products group Reckitt and Coleman Plc climbed on Tuesday on the back of higher-than-expected 1996 profits from Unilever Plc, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shares opened 18p higher at 727-1/2 at 0830 GMT, while Unilever shares leapt 90-1/2p to 14.83-1/2 stg.</p>
<p>&quot;Good Unilever numbers always send Reckitts higher,&quot; one market maker said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
